                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note" value="Steps run top → bottom. Each image pixel has its own colour, so you can watch it SLIDE: Step 2 moves data sideways (within a row), Step 4 moves the SAME data up/down (between rows) using the identical vslidedown / vslideup — only the mode bit changed. Gx/Gy are sign-coloured (warm +, cool −)." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5D6D7E;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="38" width="900" height="28" as="geometry"/>
